# Amendment #56 — workspace-sync (B-mode canonical→workspace)

2026-04-26. Introduces the new sealed component
`workspace-sync/` — the keystone for Luke's milestone "running
upgrade on pos3 doesn't lose workspace-specific content."
Architecture B (per-workspace embedded framework, locked
2026-04-26) replaces Architecture A (global symlink swap) for
downstream-workspace pull semantics. Self-upgrade remains the
canonical-only A-mode mechanism (ruling A5); workspace-sync is
the new B-mode mechanism for downstream clones (e.g. pos3).

